          "description": "Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-t) cos(pi z) with K = 1 + z on the interfaces and the matching forcing S, zero interface fluxes, quadratic-stretch column. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring; the t=0.1 assertion bounds the L2 error at the default NLEV = 64 (second-order; per-resolution values pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_column_varcoeff_forced/golden/errors.json).",
